NEC V60/V70 CPU core and disassembler (v60.hpp, v60.cpp, the am*.hxx / op*.hxx /
optable.hxx files, v60d.hpp, v60d.cpp), transcribed from MAME 0.264
src/devices/cpu/v60 (v60.cpp, v60.h, am.hxx, am1.hxx, am2.hxx, am3.hxx, op12.hxx,
op2.hxx, op3.hxx, op4.hxx, op5.hxx, op6.hxx, op7a.hxx, optable.hxx, v60d.cpp, v60d.h).

Copyright-holders: Farfetch'd, R. Belmont
License: BSD-3-Clause

v60mem.hpp contains memory_read_generic / memory_write_generic transcribed from
MAME 0.264 src/emu/emumem.h.

